<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 68.35 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 68.35 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 68.35 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 268.44 million rands on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
